    "detailed_description": "Travel through deep space while being attacked by space robots and trying to save the World. What can be more exciting ? Jaro the character is put in an unfortunate situation and the faith of his people lays in his hands. Either you manage to fullfil this task or not, you are in for the adventure of your life !! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nJaro adventures is a 2d action/adventure platformer. You play as a character Jaro and through levels try to defeat enemies that get in your way. Try to collect as much coins as those will buy you character upgrades.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome of the game features:<br />\r\n- 37 levels on earth and space<br />\r\n- 2 completely different gameplays and 3 different biomes<br />\r\n- Collection of upgrades for character and his ship<br />\r\n- Many different enemy types",
